{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170189-pentex-and-organized-crime","id":1170189,"title":"PENTEX and Organized Crime","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-24T08:48:09-08:00","id":1170189,"title":"PENTEX and Organized Crime","content":"I might buy Werewolf 20th ED tomorrow and i am planning on setting my first campaign in New Orleans. In the campaign, one of the more prominent antagonists is probably gonna be the New Orleans criminal underworld, specifically, The Dixie Mafia, ( <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dixie_Mafia\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dixie_Mafia</a>) and The Russian Mafia. I am planning on having these two factions, along with other criminal gangs, have hidden ties with PENTEX. Would Pentex have ties with organized crime and if so, how would they do business with them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12186,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","user":"Killerclown","date":". 12-24-2017, 11:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T09:19:01-08:00","id":1170195,"title":"","content":"I think it's sort of a case by case issue for each Subsidiary. Each Subsidiary's business - tobacco, pharmaceuticals, oil, toys, media, RPGs - have their own unique and often weird and fascinating history that includes a long list of potential misdeeds and/or demonizations by opponents. For example, there is a <a href=\"http://mentalfloss.com/article/30738/why-mob-often-tied-garbage-industry\" target=\"_blank\">long history</a> of the mafia/organized crime being heavily involved with waste management/garbage disposal (primarily for money laundering, but for other things as well), so Ardus Enterprises is probably pretty heavily mobbed up. Black Dog Games, on the other hand, probably isn't, but does have it's own issues of demon worship and whatnot. <br /> <br /> Anyway, Ardus and the garbage disposal business is probably your best window for a Pentex/Mafia connection (and I'm sure they have the waste disposal contract with all of the city's O'Tolley's restaurants). <br /> <br /> Also, if you've never seen/read John Grisham's The Firm (or the film with Tom Cruise), it's about a Memphis based law firm that works heavily with the mob. I forget the name of Pentex's pet legal firm, but I would presume they'd have something similar going on. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T10:28:40-08:00","id":1170224,"title":"","content":"Ardus being in bed with the mob makes sense. I can see a Russian mob boss buying a Ardus franchise and using it as a cover for drug smuggling. That is, if Ardus does franchising. I can also see Herculean selling Firearms to mobsters and gangbangers in back room deals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T14:53:42-08:00","id":1170288,"title":"","content":"King Breweries would be another possible one. They have a whole import / export wing that they use to help them circumvent customs restrictions on certain -- ahem, <i>unusual</i> items... The Mob would be really into that. I also remember somewhere that back in the 1980s (I think) somebody came up with a scam in which liquor was imported as industrial solvents to skirt duties. Supposedly, the Mob (I seem to remember it being the Russian Mob, but don't quote me there) was heavily involved. That thing eventually got turned into an episode of Law &amp; Order if memory serves.<br /> <br /> \u200bThe Mob and Pentex at large would also find common cause in Trafficking-in-Persons operations. (Pentex for the psychological and emotional harm it does, and the Mob for the money).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/19/w20supporterheavymetal1.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/545/7z8m.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/829/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3506-uniform-two-six","name":"Uniform Two Six","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3506_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"455"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T16:14:30-08:00","id":1170310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170189-pentex-and-organized-crime?p=1170288#post1170288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">King Breweries would be another possible one. They have a whole import / export wing that they use to help them circumvent customs restrictions on certain -- ahem, <i>unusual</i> items... The Mob would be really into that. I also remember somewhere that back in the 1980s (I think) somebody came up with a scam in which liquor was imported as industrial solvents to skirt duties. Supposedly, the Mob (I seem to remember it being the Russian Mob, but don't quote me there) was heavily involved. That thing eventually got turned into an episode of Law &amp; Order if memory serves.<br /> <br /> \u200bThe Mob and Pentex at large would also find common cause in Trafficking-in-Persons operations. (Pentex for the psychological and emotional harm it does, and the Mob for the money).</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, one of my plots involves Wyrm-tainted Moonshine being made by Bootleggers connected to the Dixie Mob. Perhaps King could be one of their buyers? In fact, I like the idea of the Dixie Mob helping King smuggle in booze to circumvent bans, for a price. The Russians on the other hand, will be on board to work with Pentex in Human Smuggling. I wonder which Board Member could work best with Mobsters?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T17:35:55-08:00","id":1170324,"title":"","content":"Oil and commercial fishing are also major Gulf industries, so Endron and Hallahan probably also have activities in the area. <br /> <br /> As for Herculean, while I'm sure a percentage of their product &quot;goes missing&quot; and ends up in the hands of criminals every year (likely defective stuff that doesn't pass normal quality control standards), they're more likely to focus on exclusive contracts with private security firms (i.e., mercenaries and paramilitary units, including Pentex First Teams) and the sort of high powered &quot;hunting&quot; rifles that are really designed to take down Garou and other massive beasts. <br /> <br /> And, from a pure dork standpoint, New Orleans has several times been the host for the annual G.I.Joe Collectors Convention, which in the WoD would mean Avalon Toys' Action Bill<span style=\"font-size:11px\">\u2122</span> line of hyper masculine hetronormative pro fascist big gun wielding action figures. Remember, kids, Action Bill says to always take your Magadon Super-Manly MegaVitaRoids<span style=\"font-size:11px\">\u2122</span> because Might Makes Right!<span style=\"font-size:11px\">\u2122</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T18:06:40-08:00","id":1170328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>No One of Consequence</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170189-pentex-and-organized-crime?p=1170324#post1170324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oil and commercial fishing are also major Gulf industries, so Endron and Hallahan probably also have activities in the area.<br /> <br /> As for Herculean, while I'm sure a percentage of their product &quot;goes missing&quot; and ends up in the hands of criminals every year (likely defective stuff that doesn't pass normal quality control standards), they're more likely to focus on exclusive contracts with private security firms (i.e., mercenaries and paramilitary units, including Pentex First Teams) and the sort of high powered &quot;hunting&quot; rifles that are really designed to take down Garou and other massive beasts.<br /> <br /> And, from a pure dork standpoint, New Orleans has several times been the host for the annual G.I.Joe Collectors Convention, which in the WoD would mean Avalon Toys' Action Bill<span style=\"font-size:11px\">\u2122</span> line of hyper masculine hetronormative pro fascist big gun wielding action figures. Remember, kids, Action Bill says to always take your Magadon Super-Manly MegaVitaRoids<span style=\"font-size:11px\">\u2122</span> because Might Makes Right!<span style=\"font-size:11px\">\u2122</span></div> </div> </div> </div>Good point with Herculean. I wonder if Hallahan or Endron would be willing to hire thugs from The Dixie Mob to do some of their dirty work that does not involve Garou. This would make sense because the real life Dixie Mob had a reputation for contract killing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T18:27:30-08:00","id":1170332,"title":"","content":"Oh, sure. Any organized crime outfit that claims control over the city docks and other areas is very likely to be available as muscle for hire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T21:20:16-08:00","id":1170365,"title":"","content":"Yeah, i guess the Dixie Mob would own the docks. I wonder if Pentex would tip off these two factions about the rampaging bipedal wolves that are planning on ripping their throats out if the three are in bed with each other?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T21:41:12-08:00","id":1170367,"title":"","content":"Large scale businesses in the US generally do not have anything to do with organized crime. It generates too much risk for whatever profit it brings. And since PENTEX is already involved in its own criminal activities, this just risks even more attention. Besides for most businesses, when they interact with criminals it is a form of additional expense (the mob is shaking them down), not sales.<br /> <br /> Small businesses, which are fronts for criminal gangs, are different. Those exist in order to launder money, commit fraud, and allow corrupt political connections give them money in return for services. The aforementioned waste management companies which are mobbed up are all small companies that operate locally. Waste Management, Inc. is not mobbed up, and is noted for working with law enforcement to drive out the mobbed up companies so they can provide services at a cheaper price to municipalities.<br /> <br /> It is possible that some parts of PENTEX might need someone to assist them in their own criminal enterprises and contract out to organized crime, but in reality I don't think they would. PENTEX has at its disposal so many resources in the form of First Teams, vampires, BSDs, Fomori, and others that it staggers my mind why they would need to go outside the company. They already have the infrastructure, organization, and resources to handle their own needs.<br /> <br /> I think the only real connection is going to be tangential and personal - someone wants access to prostitutes, illegal drugs for their own use, to kill someone who offends them, etc.<br /> <br /> There may be cases where PENTEX needs operational deniability and use buffers in order to pass certain things into the criminal network and evaluate them. They need human testing for some kind of new drug that could create fomori. So after going through some front organizations, the drug ends up in the hands of local drug pushers to go into the community, and PENTEX can observe the results. But in these cases, PENTEX is using the local organized crime gangs, and always try to use buffers to protect them from blowback.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-24T21:52:10-08:00","id":1170369,"title":"","content":"Good point Black Fox.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T02:32:32-08:00","id":1170392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Uniform Two Six</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1170189-pentex-and-organized-crime?p=1170288#post1170288\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u200bThe Mob and Pentex at large would also find common cause in Trafficking-in-Persons operations. (Pentex for the psychological and emotional harm it does, and the Mob for the money).</div> </div> </div> </div>This is actually really interesting, because human trafficking has got to be a HUGE deal in WoD. What subsidiary of Pentex is the most likely to be involved in this?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11876-deinos","name":"Deinos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"311"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T07:04:42-08:00","id":1170419,"title":"","content":"Just bought W:20 today. I am about to read through it. I also got Book of the Wyrm, perhaps it could give me some inspiration into what mobsters and gangster tainted by the Wyrm could do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T09:43:01-08:00","id":1170460,"title":"","content":"If you've never seen it, I recommend the movie <b>Innocent Blood</b> (1992), a &quot;vampire vs. mafia&quot; film directed by John Landis of American Werewolf in London fame. (I like to believe the two films are set in the same universe.) Beyond that, I'm hard pressed to think of much in the way of mafia meets supernatural films.<br /> <br /> Also, for the purpose of any Werewolf game set in Louisiana, I highly, <i>highly</i> recommend <b>Fletch Lives</b> (1989). It is a comedy, but in the same vein as Beverly Hills Cop, in which there is a serious mystery going on amidst all the humor. The plot is pretty much tailor made for a Werewolf chronicle, and includes R. Lee Ermey of all people as a crooked televangelist.<br /> <br /> Also, Southern Comfort (1981), Angel Heart (1987) and Skeleton Key (2005). There's also a documentary, Pushcarts &amp; Plantations: Jewish Life in Louisiana, which I've never seen but have been told is pretty good.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":12890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","user":"No One of Consequence","date":". 12-25-2017, 12:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T10:09:13-08:00","id":1170466,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the suggestions. You know, a Wyrm tainted Televangelist sounds like a interesting antagonist, especially in a game set in the Bible Belt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T17:57:36-08:00","id":1170562,"title":"","content":"Like someone else said, organized crime might be a little &quot;small&quot; for any Pentex subsidiary. <br /> <br /> BUT:<br /> <br /> Maybe bring it a bit more local and grounded, in that perhaps a ________(fill in any Pentex subsidiary) employee has gotten himself or herself involved with organized crime and go from there.<br /> <br /> Maybe that Magadon employee is supplying a special brand of steroids to the Russian mob--which Magadon doesn't know about. And that Russian mob happens to be giving said steroids to a local professional wrestling organization resulting in...well...have fun with that one.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-25T18:06:56-08:00","id":1170563,"title":"","content":"That is a good idea Fat Larry. I wonder how Magadon is gonna react if and when they find out someone is swiping their steroids?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12186-killerclown","name":"Killerclown","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"819"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-01-03T16:41:34-08:00","id":1173113,"title":"","content":"I asked somewhere what the chances of a Connection between pentex and Westboro were, were told Westboro isnt that effective in trying to overturn laws... its just a scam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}